-# "Beitragshöhe": the regular fee, the active total fee reduction, a planned
-# one and the history of the active one. Seen with the privileged view
-# (fee_page_privileged?: :log on the person, or the finance audit tier); the
-# comments need :log on accounting entries (audit tier); planning, activating
-# and discarding need :update_finance (Person::FeeReductionController).
-#
-# Saving, activating and discarding answer with a page refresh that morphs the
-# page and keeps the scroll position (turbo_refreshes_with on the page), so the
-# section stays where it is; their notice shows here, not at the top.
-#
-# context: :person (default) on the person's Beitrag page, with the heading;
-# :fin inside a row of the Reduktionen list (fin/fee_reductions), without it.
-# Both offer the buttons and the form: every section has its own place for them
-# (fee_reduction_actions_id) and its own notice, and both pages morph their
-# refresh.
- context = local_assigns.fetch(:context, :person)
- on_person_page = context == :person
- show_comment = can?(:log, AccountingEntry)
- may_change = can?(:update_finance, person)
- active = person.active_total_fee_reduction
-# The regular fee as the fee computation takes it (Person#total_fee_cents).
- regular_cents = person.total_fee_cents + (active * 100).to_i
- planned = person.planned_total_fee_reduction
- versions = fee_reduction_versions(person).to_a

-# The anchor #total_fee_<id> (total_fee_anchor): unique also where the
-# sections of several people share a page.
%section.fee-reduction{id: total_fee_anchor(person), class: on_person_page ? "mt-4" : "mt-1"}
  - if on_person_page
    %h2.mb-2 Beitragshöhe
  - if (notice = fee_reduction_notice(person)).present?
    .alert.alert-success.py-1.px-2.mb-2= notice
  .d-flex.justify-content-between
    %span= "Regulärer Beitrag (#{person.short_payment_role})"
    %span= format_cents_de(regular_cents)
  - if active != 0
    -# Indented under the regular fee; the hint names the reduction, "Reduktion"
    -# stands in where there is none.
    .d-flex.justify-content-between.ps-3
      %span
        = person.active_total_fee_reduction_hint.presence || "Reduktion"
        - if person.active_total_fee_reduction_issue.present?
          %span.muted (#{auto_link_escaped_multiline(person.active_total_fee_reduction_issue)})
      %span= "− #{format_eur_de(active)}"
    - if show_comment && person.active_total_fee_reduction_comment.present?
      -# Indented like the reduction's line it belongs to.
      .fee-reduction-comment.fw-light.fst-italic.ps-3
        = auto_link_escaped_multiline(person.active_total_fee_reduction_comment)
    .d-flex.justify-content-between.border-top.fw-semibold
      %span Reduzierter Beitrag
      %span= format_cents_de(person.total_fee_cents)
  -# The installments must bring in the fee: yellow when they bring in more,
  -# red when they bring in less.
  = fee_reduction_installments_alert(person)

  - if planned.present?
    .alert.alert-warning.mt-2.mb-2.py-2
      .d-flex.justify-content-between
        %span
          Geplant: Reduktion #{format_eur_de(planned)}
          - if person.planned_total_fee_reduction_hint.present?
            = "· #{person.planned_total_fee_reduction_hint}"
          - if person.planned_total_fee_reduction_issue.present?
            (#{auto_link_escaped_multiline(person.planned_total_fee_reduction_issue)})
        - planned_fee_cents = [regular_cents.to_i - (planned * 100).to_i, 0].max
        %span= "→ #{format_cents_de(planned_fee_cents)}"
      - if show_comment && person.planned_total_fee_reduction_comment.present?
        .fee-reduction-comment.fw-light.fst-italic
          = auto_link_escaped_multiline(person.planned_total_fee_reduction_comment)
      = fee_reduction_planned_installments_note(person, planned_fee_cents)

  -# The buttons, or the plan's form in their place (Turbo streams of
  -# Person::FeeReductionController, targeting fee_reduction_actions_id). No
  -# turbo frame: a frame that showed the
  -# form keeps the form's URL as src, and a page refresh that morphs the page
  -# would load it again.
  - if may_change
    %div{id: fee_reduction_actions_id(person)}
      = render "person/fee_reduction/buttons", person: person, context: on_person_page ? "person" : "fin"

  -# The changes of the active reduction; nothing at all without any.
  - if versions.any?
    %h4.mt-3 Änderungen am Beitrag
    - versions.each do |version|
      .mt-2
        .muted.small= fee_reduction_version_header(version)
        %div= fee_reduction_change_lines(version)
